MODEL 79 — CATALYSIS EXPLORER

Core objective

Create an interactive laboratory demonstrating how catalysts provide alternative reaction pathways and affect reaction kinetics without changing the overall thermodynamic equilibrium at a fixed temperature.

A. 3D catalyst scene

Construct a scientifically interpretable catalytic environment appropriate to the chosen example.

Where a heterogeneous catalyst is demonstrated, include:

